      "lines": [
        "Q&A: “What can I expect for grading?”",
        "• Timeline",
        "• Due to many students (~200), grades will be released up to 5 days after submission",
        "• Policies:",
        "• Late policy: penalty of 1% of the grade per hour up to 12 hours, rounded up to the",
        "nearest hour; then 25% for up to 24 hours late; and then 50% for up to 48 hours",
        "late. After 48 hours, no credit will be given.",
        "• Regrade requests: must submit to TA within 2 weeks of receiving the grade"
      ]
    },
